** {color:#97a0af}_A background card that links to the product overview and contains the following information:_{color}
*** {color:#97a0af}_the icon (XL) to the menu item "Produktübersicht"._{color}
*** {color:#97a0af}_an info (red circle with corresponding number) about the number of my open tasks_{color}
