*** {color:#97a0af}_the icon (XL) to the menu item "Produzenten_{color}
*** {color:#97a0af}_a headline_{color}
*** {color:#97a0af}_the number of participating producers, in total_{color}
*** {color:#97a0af}_a button "Ansehen" (enabled)_{color}
** {color:#97a0af}_A background card that links to the order overview and contains the following information:_{color}
*** {color:#97a0af}_the icon (XL) to the "Auftragsübersicht" menu item_{color}
*** {color:#97a0af}_an info (red circle with corresponding number) about the number of my open tasks_{color}
